   "rdfs:label": "William Strunk Jr.",
   "skos:altLabel": [
    "Professor Strunk",
    "Will Strunk",
    "William Strunk"
   ],
   "skos:definition": "Cornell English professor (1869-1946) whose 1918 classroom handbook, The Elements of Style, set out short imperative rules such as using the active voice and omitting needless words; revised by his former student E. B. White in 1959, it became the best-known American writing guide.",
   "skos:inScheme": {
